    "body": "ready for a re-check.\n\nI merged origin/main (2f965f7) into the branch, then merged the pushed branch tip (7b071ad) to pull the base forward. One easy conflict: the module list at the end of `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`. Both sides added lines. I kept main's `mod guide_projects;` and `mod guide_images;`. No logic hunk was resolved by hand.\n\nTargeted gate, green: `ui suites: lib` and the 7 ui suites (9 of 9 steps), plus the `camcraft-app` lib unit tests (367 passed).\n\nThree suites in the full quick plan are red for causes outside this branch:\n\n- `microarc_test_part`: red on main, tracked in #2483.\n- `example_catalog` and `first_part_programs`: byte-pin failures in a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true`, because `.gitattributes` does not pin `examples/*.nc` to LF. Filed as #2523. They pass on Linux.",
